        "note": "Without chocks, the airplane can creep as parking brake pressure bleeds away.",
        "why": "Holds the airplane without the brake",
        "check": "Chocks in place before the brake is released",
        "confirmed_by": [
          {
            "kind": "vendor-docs",
            "date": "2026-11-09"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
